{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25535","headline":"祗役遇风谢湘中春色 · 熊孺登","name":"祗役遇风谢湘中春色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水生风熟布帆新，只见公程不见春。\n应被百花撩乱笑，比来天地一闲人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"熊孺登","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25535.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25535","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《三体唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三體唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}